# onnxruntime-node (from @iwsdk/reference -> @huggingface/transformers) downloads
# its optional CUDA binaries from GitHub releases on Linux x64 during install.
# That download now returns 404, which fails `npm ci`. The docs search never
# uses the GPU, so skip it; ONNX Runtime still works on the CPU.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
